abstract: >-
  Standalone HTML page, guided by Sparky the beaver, that groups a selectable
  count of synthetic frame slots (32 to 1,048,576 in steps of 32) into groups of
  32 and renders at most 2,048 display bins on a canvas. Every value is generated
  in the browser; nothing is measured and no sensor, device or network is used.
  Counts above 65,536 frame slots are visualization-only and do not extend the
  separate Python array prototype (65,536 software slots) or the separate
  synthetic robustness benchmark (tested through 32,768 channels).
keywords:
  - synthetic data
